  "_comment": "Paths sensitive-file scanners request, and the AWS managed rules that block each one at the versions below. These were the default versions when recorded, so an unpinned group counts; one pinned to an older version doesn't. An empty list means no AWS managed rule blocks the path. Keep in step with Appendix I in waf-generate-appendix.py.",
  "versions": {"AWSManagedRulesLinuxRuleSet": "2.6", "AWSManagedRulesKnownBadInputsRuleSet": "1.26", "AWSManagedRulesCommonRuleSet": "1.23"},
